* step60: TPS61178 (TI SLVMC02A transient model) - spec_power.md section 4.1
.include ../models/TPS61178_TRANS.LIB
* --- input: VSYS from the BQ25792 (30 mOhm source) + C901/C902 (derated) + C903
VSRC vsrc 0 6.0
RSRC vsrc vsys 30m
CIN vsys 0 2.4e-05 IC=6.0
* --- power stage
VIL vsys l_in 0
L1 l_in l_x 2.2e-06 IC=0
RL l_x sw 0.007
XU 0 bst comp disdrv en fb freq ilim 0 sw vcc vsys pvdd TPS61178_TRANS PARAMS: SS=0
VEN en 0 PWL(0 0 100u 0 101u 3.3)
RFREQ freq 0 300000.0
RILIM ilim 0 82000.0
RC comp cz 33000.0
CC cz 0 4.7e-08 IC=1.43
CP comp 0 1e-11 IC=1.43
CBST bst sw 100n
CVCC vcc 0 4.7u
* --- feedback divider R904 / (R905 || R906)
RUP pvdd fb 300000.0
RDN fb 0 21428.57
* --- PVDD bank: COUT1 at the IC, 3x 470 uF electrolytics, amp-sheet ceramics
COUT1 pvdd 0 3.6e-05 IC=18.000
CHF pvdd 0 100n IC=18.000
CEL1 pvdd e1 0.00047 IC=18.000
REL1 e1 e1l 0.15
LEL1 e1l 0 5e-09
CEL2 pvdd e2 0.00047 IC=18.000
REL2 e2 e2l 0.15
LEL2 e2l 0 5e-09
CEL3 pvdd e3 0.00047 IC=18.000
REL3 e3 e3l 0.15
LEL3 e3l 0 5e-09
CAMP pvdd 0 3.6e-05 IC=18.000
* --- load (amps in PDN for start-up: ~uA; current source for load steps)
RBLEED pvdd 0 1Meg
ILOAD pvdd 0 PWL(0 0.2 0.012 0.2 0.012001 2.0 0.0145 2.0 0.014501 0.2)
.options method=trap reltol=1e-3 abstol=1e-9 vntol=1e-5 itl4=200
.save v(pvdd) i(vil) v(comp) v(fb) v(vsys) 
.tran 5e-08 0.017 0 50n uic
.control
run
linearize v(pvdd) i(vil) v(comp) v(fb) v(vsys) 
write step60.raw v(pvdd) i(vil) v(comp) v(fb) v(vsys) 
.endc
.end
